# Large model artifacts for the scoring/ plugins (kept local; baked into the
# Docker image via COPY). trigram.pkl alone is 226 MB > GitHub's 100 MB limit.
# The tiny recommender weights JSON IS committed (deterministic, fitted on the
# committed HDTB corpus by `python -m evaluation.fit_weights`) — hence the
# contents-form ignore (`/*`), since git can't re-include from an ignored dir.
scoring/models/*
!scoring/models/recommender_weights.json

